  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Zambia-Cotton &amp; Textiles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to inclusive sustainable value chains and trade in an innovative way, in which the interests, voices and rights of farmers, workers and citizens (m/f) are represented and heard in decision making for sustainable use of natural resources, decent work, fair value distribution, and sustainable consumption. It also aims to contribute to a responsible, inclusive, and climate smart global cotton and textiles value chain, in which smallholder cotton farmers and garment workers in Zambia  benefit from decent work, earn a living income, get a fairer value in the chain, and ecosystems are protected.</narrative>
  </description>
